# T_SCRE: the walk from a copy through its Parts tab: item 2 installed
# in the copy of item 1 (the tab's own note), the part opened from the
# tab and left, then the copy's form left, the list showing "Copied as
# item 46".  Then item 3 installed in the copy of item 2, opened and
# saved from the tab: the copy's form shows "Item 3 saved", and once it
# is left the list shows no note of the copy.
K CTRL-D
S COPY1
K ALT-C P
S PARTS
K INS
S ASKID
T 2
K ENTER
S INSTALL
K ENTER
S PART
K ESC
S BACK
K ESC
S LIST
K DOWN CTRL-D
K ALT-C P INS
T 3
K ENTER ENTER CTRL-E CTRL-S
S PSAVED
K ESC
S NONOTE
K ESC
